    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Hex.</strong> You always have the Hex spell prepared. Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for it (choose when you take this feat). You can cast it once without a spell slot, and you regain the ability to cast it that way when you finish a Long Rest. You can also cast it using any spell slots you have.</p><p><strong>Curse Magic.</strong> When a creature you have cursed with Hex hits you with an attack roll, it takes Psychic damage equal to your Proficiency Bonus. A creature takes this damage only once per turn.</p>",
